// /mobbattle test preview scene (experiment, 2026-10-16, user: "a VS in 3D? let's try it"): the mobs around the player
// in two sides facing each other, in ONE 3D viewer inside a HUD across the screen. PreviewTest.scene fills it.
// Same layout pattern as PreviewHud.ui (a Right layout and a box with a fixed width): a Top layout with only margins
// gave the box no height and nothing showed (user, 2026-10-16).
Group #Scene {
  Anchor: (Left: 0, Right: 0, Top: 0, Bottom: 0);
  LayoutMode: Right;

  Group #SceneBox {
    Anchor: (Width: 1800, Right: 60, Top: 90, Bottom: 150);
    Background: #0b1118(0.55);
    LayoutMode: Full;

    PrefabPreviewComponent #Preview {
      AllowDragYaw: false;
      AllowDragPitch: false;
      AllowZoom: false;
      AllowPan: false;
      ShowAnchor: false;
    }
  }
}
